Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.86,0:00:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（米扎艾尔）与九十九游马的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.41,0:00:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗中败北，紧接着{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.46,0:00:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又遭到埋伏，竟落得这副模样……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.02,0:00:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真丢人。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.13,0:00:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((阿里特：被干掉了……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.76,0:00:19.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（基拉古）是……被谁！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真……月……))
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.61,0:00:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么剩下的巴利安球体立方只剩一个了……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.15,0:00:36.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特的仇由我来报……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.61,0:00:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只有我能报！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别被感情冲昏头脑，迷失了目的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.11,0:00:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的目的终究只是回收 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我清楚得很。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你……难道……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.05,0:00:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打算用那张 No.卡吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.35,0:00:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.06,0:01:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然你有那样的觉悟，就交给你吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.66,0:01:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我先把阿里特带上回巴利安去。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你看着吧，阿里特……我一定会！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）为什么一大早就{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.47,0:02:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}非得被狗追着跑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.92,0:02:53.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.40,0:02:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底还不是因为你多管闲事！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.75,0:02:58.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（真月）我是觉得抄近路比较好才～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.31,0:03:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果狗还变多了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.28,0:03:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的，饶了我吧～！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.10,0:03:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）哇～你们两个没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.81,0:03:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，没事没事。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇，好痛痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.99,0:03:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）真是的都这样了还要迟到啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.79,0:03:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）有我在的话狗什么的我一击就能搞定喵！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.83,0:03:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.86,0:03:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是觉得那样比较好才……。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.58,0:03:30.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力）所以说 到头来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.26,0:03:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成好结果这种事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.50,0:03:32.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一次都没有过吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.46,0:03:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德之助）全都适得其反了汪。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.66,0:03:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.59,0:03:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别在意啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天也是惊险刺激满分啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.26,0:03:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果 游马也乐在其中汪。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.94,0:03:49.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到头来这两个人就是一对好搭档呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.26,0:03:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呐 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:03:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天没看到星光体呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.15,0:03:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊……啊啊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.69,0:04:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在和米扎艾尔还有阿里特战斗过的场地上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙的身体好像受到了伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.59,0:04:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在只能在这里面慢慢养好身体了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（基拉格）九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.78,0:04:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.03,0:04:24.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉格！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.76,0:04:28.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）小心点，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.24,0:04:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他可能又设下了什么圈套。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:35.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:40.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马……跟我决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.55,0:04:44.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把你所有的 No.卡都收下！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.28,0:04:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别慌！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明天傍晚，我在那里等你。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次是正面较量！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.46,0:04:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带上真月一起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.30,0:04:55.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.63,0:04:56.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.78,0:05:00.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把你们俩一起收拾掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.16,0:05:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！为什么需要真月！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.93,0:05:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！你们好像
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.92,0:05:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还不知道那家伙的真面目啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:10.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙偷袭了阿里特！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.49,0:05:12.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月对阿里特！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.11,0:05:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种卑鄙小人绝不能原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.34,0:05:17.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等……等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月他　怎么可能做那种事……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙　搞偷袭什么的根本不可能做得到吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.41,0:05:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么　你能这么断言？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.70,0:05:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.45,0:05:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.18,0:05:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.96,0:05:32.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:34.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是　因为那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是个废物啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.97,0:05:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也是按你自己的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.81,0:05:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想帮他圆场吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.03,0:05:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得也太过分了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟你说话　节奏全乱了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.59,0:05:51.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去问本人啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.72,0:06:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在想什么想得那么入神？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.88,0:06:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特明明是巴利安的人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.91,0:06:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}却让人讨厌不起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的阿里特真月居然偷袭了他……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.79,0:06:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种事我觉得不可能会有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.37,0:06:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 我 害怕去问真月。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.10,0:06:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～ 真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.83,0:06:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然犹豫不决 那就先飞冲再说。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.59,0:06:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这不正是 你会说的话吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.57,0:06:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你平时不都这么说的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.78,0:06:33.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.48,0:06:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.06,0:06:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早上好 游马同学。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.09,0:06:43.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.99,0:06:43.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其实呢{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.29,0:06:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我找到了去学校的新最短路线！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.36,0:06:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 我 对你……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.56,0:06:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没关系！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.26,0:06:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天早上 我以为是好事我真的实际跑了一趟。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君 相信我！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.51,0:06:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.73,0:06:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说得也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.21,0:07:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.24,0:07:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我当然相信你啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.71,0:07:11.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？这次是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要经过这种地方吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.34,0:07:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.67,0:07:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铁男君！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.97,0:07:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 不在。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.29,0:07:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.50,0:07:23.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月君 你看到游马了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.53,0:07:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君的话已经回去了哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.52,0:07:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说是要去个地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然还是一个人去了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.33,0:07:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）铁男！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.35,0:07:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，发生什么事了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.52,0:07:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有，没什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.55,0:07:38.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那，明天见！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.97,0:07:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的没问题吗？游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.27,0:07:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.77,0:07:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我相信真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.89,0:07:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然游马还是对真月保密啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.64,0:07:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.53,0:07:59.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙也让我们不许说出去。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部一个人扛着，进行决斗……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）啊……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.17,0:08:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（基拉格）九十九游马，星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月不会来！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.77,0:08:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟我决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方说让你带我来决斗的吗？是对方说的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.86,0:08:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，为什么，什么都不……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.75,0:08:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马是不想把真月君卷进来啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.72,0:08:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗的地点在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:46.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你问了又能怎样。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:48.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然要去！必须去！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！就算你去了……。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.13,0:08:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实我决斗也很差劲{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.56,0:08:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是个胆小的废物。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:58.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月君……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.37,0:08:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.59,0:09:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即便如此我还是希望你能告诉我。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就像游马
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.77,0:09:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我当作朋友一样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也明明把游马当作朋友……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.86,0:09:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道了，真月君。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.91,0:09:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走吧，去游马那里。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.42,0:09:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，小鸟……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月没来是怎么回事！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.88,0:09:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.81,0:09:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不来就是不来！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.16,0:09:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底，你的目的就是我的 No.卡吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.47,0:09:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，没错！但比起那个{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把那个卑鄙小人揍得落花流水！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.40,0:09:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙绝对不会做那种事！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.18,0:09:45.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就先把你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:48.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}撕成碎片，再甩到真月面前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.82,0:09:50.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，再把那家伙彻底击溃！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（真月）请等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.11,0:09:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.11,0:10:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你怎么来了！？这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.93,0:10:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可不是普通的决斗啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.25,0:10:05.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙说，让我把你带过去对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.11,0:10:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.63,0:10:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然是因为我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}信不过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.46,0:10:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为根本不需要我！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.64,0:10:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.23,0:10:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我决斗虽然很菜，但我会努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别丢下我啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.11,0:10:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.51,0:10:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一起上吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.82,0:10:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，绝对别乱来。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.05,0:10:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会保护你的。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.81,0:10:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别开玩笑了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.04,0:10:39.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们别以为能平安无事！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.11,0:10:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界球场地，展开！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.55,0:10:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.98,0:11:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月，你竟敢对阿里特居然敢偷袭我。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.28,0:11:17.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用这个场地把你撕成碎片！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.00,0:11:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我做了什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.07,0:11:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿里特说了，是你干的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.45,0:11:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就足够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.18,0:11:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此，我也一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.15,0:11:28.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我相信真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.91,0:11:31.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.22,0:11:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冷静点，游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.85,0:11:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他那种气势，跟之前完全……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.55,0:11:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！你没事吧！？喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.01,0:11:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没、没事。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.07,0:11:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然，是这个场地的影响吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你还是待在钥匙里面比较好。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他的决斗还远远不够成熟。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.83,0:11:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞不好连一起战斗的你也会……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.77,0:12:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 需要的是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 要赢啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:06.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.11,0:12:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.07,0:12:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.23,0:12:30.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利尔… 变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.15,0:12:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是 那家伙真正的样子！？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.17,0:12:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 让我们开始吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.24,0:13:00.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（3人）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.37,0:13:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗 以混战规则进行。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.59,0:13:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}3人各自
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.65,0:13:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在最初的回合结束之前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.96,0:13:09.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.16,0:13:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先 是我的回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.32,0:13:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.85,0:13:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 召唤火焰手！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:28.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！ 火焰手！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.66,0:13:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这些家伙 就由我赌上一切来打倒！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.52,0:13:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连骨头都不剩{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.89,0:13:42.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你烧个精光！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.79,0:13:48.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己把怪兽装备上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.71,0:13:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明不是攻击，这冲击力也太猛了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.45,0:13:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙什么来头。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.05,0:13:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马君，由我先来。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.73,0:14:02.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦…哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.43,0:14:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合。抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.27,0:14:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也能帮上游马君的忙。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先，巩固守备。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.59,0:14:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤闪光轰炸机。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.22,0:14:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙傻了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.09,0:14:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力零？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.66,0:14:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.16,0:14:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不小心用攻击表示了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.01,0:14:30.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这可真是杰作。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.79,0:14:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把攻击力为零的怪兽用攻击表示召唤出来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.43,0:14:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加强防守？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.30,0:14:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（真月）游马，对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没、没事。别在意。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.53,0:14:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 这可是基础中的基础啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.39,0:14:44.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对犯了更多错的他……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁都会犯错。我也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.13,0:14:49.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.17,0:14:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别磨磨唧唧的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.92,0:14:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算失败了也要一飞冲天，真月。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.02,0:14:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.13,0:14:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 现在 我们面对的对手是巴利安。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.59,0:15:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个失误之后一定会产生影响。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.98,0:15:05.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。所以 由我来守护。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.37,0:15:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}主动投身这场危险决斗的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.96,0:15:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月，由我来守护。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.20,0:15:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡，回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.63,0:15:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了，我的回合。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.20,0:15:17.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.51,0:15:20.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将怒怒怒破坏者特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.66,0:15:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在　自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有怪兽的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.83,0:15:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把等级下降２级就能特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.16,0:15:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等。　异晶人的目标是 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.73,0:15:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在要　加强防守。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.09,0:15:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是这么做的话真月就要被攻击了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.71,0:15:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我必须保护真月才行。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.51,0:15:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.63,0:15:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.59,0:15:50.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得　他好像非常难受。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.44,0:15:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看起来身体不舒服。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.31,0:15:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着我　召唤毅力骑士。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.30,0:16:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级４的怪兽有２只！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.46,0:16:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用　等级４的怒怒怒破坏者和
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.97,0:16:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毅力骑士进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.82,0:16:10.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用２只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.09,0:16:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.68,0:16:14.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.45,0:16:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧　No.39。　希望皇霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.17,0:16:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托你了　霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.10,0:16:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我　盖放一张卡回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.33,0:16:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么快就出 No.怪兽了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合。　抽卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.42,0:16:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我　召唤冰之手。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.34,0:17:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又往自己身上放怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.84,0:17:09.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用等级4的火之手和冰之手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.49,0:17:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用2只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.00,0:17:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.85,0:17:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将世间一切捏碎吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.56,0:17:34.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.106。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.28,0:17:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巨岩掌 巨手。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.44,0:17:56.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了吗。　超百 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.17,0:17:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}卑鄙的真月啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.17,0:18:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我来替阿里特报仇。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.97,0:18:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，巨手！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.91,0:18:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把闪耀轰炸粉碎掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.93,0:18:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动霍普的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.26,0:18:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.46,0:18:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效一只怪兽的攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.05,0:18:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月之屏障！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.43,0:18:24.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！发动巨手的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.68,0:18:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当对方怪兽的效果发动时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.21,0:18:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用一个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.81,0:18:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个效果无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.10,0:18:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把霍普的效果无效掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.20,0:18:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.13,0:18:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽 秘孔死爆无惚！！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普的效果被封印了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.53,0:18:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.91,0:18:54.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要巨手在场{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.90,0:18:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的霍普就无法使用怪兽效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.24,0:19:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…但是攻击力是霍普更高！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然你这么想，那就攻过来试试啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.57,0:19:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那一刻，就是你的死期。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.94,0:19:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.15,0:19:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底怎么回事……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.47,0:19:11.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到时候，你自然就明白了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.78,0:19:16.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但现在，得先把那死缠烂打的卑鄙小人揍趴下再说！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.66,0:19:18.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，巨人之手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.37,0:19:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次一定要把闪光炸弹给打碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.66,0:19:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……我没事。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.15,0:19:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}比起这个，我也不会白白挨打不还手的。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.46,0:19:44.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动闪光炸弹的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.61,0:19:47.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽被破坏的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.49,0:19:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会给对手造成600点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.20,0:19:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱卡！拒绝之手！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.49,0:19:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己场上有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.31,0:19:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}名字带有“之手”的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.46,0:20:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽存在时可以发动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.49,0:20:04.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将自身受到的效果伤害无效化。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.89,0:20:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 连自己怪兽的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.08,0:20:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都搞不明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪亮炸弹在 被破坏的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会给所有玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:16.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}造成６００点伤害啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.91,0:20:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所… 给所有玩家？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.44,0:20:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎… 怎么会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 因为巨型之手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.74,0:20:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在场上所以不会受到伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.24,0:20:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真遗憾啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.35,0:20:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明那么起劲地发动了效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.73,0:20:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（恶魔）嘿 一鼓作气。 上！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.78,0:20:48.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.88,0:20:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:52.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来两个人都是白白挨了伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.08,0:20:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手毫发无损。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.71,0:20:59.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真月 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.73,0:21:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.54,0:21:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我本以为这样做是为你好。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.00,0:21:04.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没办法啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是对方棋高一着。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.67,0:21:08.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.05,0:21:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然，这场决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.88,0:21:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一边保护他一边战斗太危险了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:15.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是…可是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.85,0:21:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那难道你是说要我抛弃真月吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.28,0:21:23.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马你的心情，我也不是不能理解。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.45,0:21:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.98,0:21:27.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少跟我说什么但是可是！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.34,0:21:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝不会抛弃真月！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.89,0:21:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星…星光体…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.49,0:21:53.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.98,0:21:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，星光体…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.14,0:21:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.86,0:22:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.91,0:23:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.70,0:23:46.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
